From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 23:56:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] xgameruntime: Implement XNetworking.

Changes from WineGDK's implementation:
- The object implements IXNetworkingImpl2, which titles ask for.
- Security information for a URL reports TLS 1.2 and 1.3 and no certificate thumbprints, so
  XNetworkingVerifyServerCertificate() has no pinning to check and succeeds; WinHTTP verifies the
  chain, the dates and the host name when it connects.
- XNetworkingRegisterConnectivityHintChanged() returns a token and delivers one notification on
  the given queue (or the process queue); unregistering before delivery cancels it.
- The connectivity hint is a desktop with unrestricted internet access; the UDP port,
  configuration and statistics functions remain stubs.

Ported from WineGDK (LGPL-2.1-or-later); changes are original work for macrock.

Topic: xnetworking
